<main class="container">
        
        <section class="fig-image-wrapper">
            <img src="/Source/Animals2/chimpanzee/chimpanzee.jpg" alt="Chimpanzee Expedition">
            
            <div class="hero-text-overlay">
                <div class="header-title">Our Closest Relative</div>
                <h2 class="header-subtitle">Chimpanzee (Pan troglodytes verus)</h2>
                <div class="iucn-badge-inline">
                    <span class="iucn-tag">IUCN Status:</span>
                    <span class="iucn-status-value">Endangered</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="content-split">
            
            <div class="carousel-container">
                <div id="carouselTrack">
                    
                    <!-- Slide 1: About -->
                    <div class="carousel-slide active">
                        <div class="carousel-italic">
                            Sharing roughly <span style="color: var(--iucn-endangered); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--text-primary); font-weight: 700;">98% of our DNA</span>, these highly intelligent apes are our closest living relatives and master <span style="border-bottom: 2px solid var(--text-primary); font-weight: 700;">tool users</span>.
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-body">
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Just like humans, each chimpanzee possesses unique physical features, including distinct variations in skin colour, hair coverage, and facial structure. Equipped with opposable thumbs and toes for gripping tools, their long arms and immense strength allow them to seamlessly transition between 'knuckle walking' and navigating the high forest canopy.</p>
                            <p>Their deep social bonds are maintained through essential grooming sessions, which act much like human handshakes or hugs. These complex communities are strictly led by an alpha male who maintains order, resolves conflicts, chooses feeding sites, and holds priority in mating.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Slide 2: Threats -->
                    <div class="carousel-slide">
                        <div class="carousel-italic">
                            A brilliant mind facing a fragmented future. Their wild populations are plummeting due to <span style="color: var(--iucn-endangered); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--text-primary); font-weight: 700;">relentless habitat loss</span> and the devastating <span style="border-bottom: 2px solid var(--text-primary); font-weight: 700;">illegal bushmeat trade</span>.
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-body">
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Illegal hunting for bushmeat currently kills more chimpanzees each year than are born, pushing them dangerously close to extinction and risking the spread of serious diseases like Ebola and HIV. Furthermore, their natural environment is declining dramatically as humans aggressively alter the landscape through farming, logging, and mining.</p>
                            <p>These sweeping land-use changes severely fragment chimpanzee populations, making it difficult for isolated groups to connect, which directly reduces their genetic diversity and weakens their overall resilience. To combat this, conservationists are actively partnering with the Nigerian National Parks Service to protect their remaining habitats.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Slide 3: Support & Experience -->
                    <div class="carousel-slide">
                        <div class="carousel-italic" style="font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
                            Support & Experience the Wildlife Firsthand
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-body">
                            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 30px; text-align: left;">
                                
                                <div style="border-left: 2px solid var(--text-muted); padding-left: 15px;">
                                    <div class="image-placeholder-slot">
                                        <img src="/Source/Animals2/chimpanzee/chimpanzee-ticket.jpg" alt="Chimpanzee Ticket">
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 6px;">Visit your favourite animals</h4>
                                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.4;">Book your visit today and see all the amazing animals at the zoo!</p>
                                    <a href="#" class="doc-btn" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 11px;">Book Now</a>
                                </div>
                                
                                <div style="border-left: 2px solid var(--text-muted); padding-left: 15px;">
                                    <div class="image-placeholder-slot">
                                        <img src="/Source/Animals2/chimpanzee/chimpanzee-membership.jpg" alt="Chimpanzee Member">
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 6px;">Become a member and don't miss a thing</h4>
                                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.4;">See these magnificent animals any day you like with free unlimited entry for a year, plus up to 10% off future experiences.</p>
                                    <a href="#" class="doc-btn" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 11px;">Become a Member</a>
                                </div>

                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="carousel-controls">
                    <button id="prevBtn" aria-label="Previous Slide">←</button>
                    <span class="slide-indicator" id="slideIndicator">1 / 3</span>
                    <button id="nextBtn" aria-label="Next Slide">→</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="fact-grid">
                
                <!-- Species Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path d="M7 11a3 3 0 1 1-3-3M17 11a3 3 0 1 0 3-3"/>
                            <path d="M12 3a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 4.5 3.5 8 7 8s7-3.5 7-8a7 7 0 0 0-7-7z"/>
                            <path d="M9 9c1-1 2-1 3 0s2 1 3 0"/>
                            <circle cx="9.5" cy="11.5" r="0.5"/>
                            <circle cx="14.5" cy="11.5" r="0.5"/>
                            <path d="M10 14h4"/>
                        </svg>
                        Species
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Primate</div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Life Span Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 2h14M5 22h14M7 2l5 8 5-8M7 22l5-8 5 8"/></svg>
                        Life Span
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Around 15 years in the wild</div>
                    <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px; display: inline-block;">30 to 60 years under human care</span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Habitat Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12,2 3,17 21,17"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="22"/></svg>
                        Habitat
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Tropical rainforests</div>
                    <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px; display: inline-block;">bamboo swamps & open savannahs</span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Region Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="22" y1="12" x2="2" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
                        Region
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Central Africa</div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Diet Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path d="M4 20l2-4" />
                            <path d="M6 16A7 7 0 0 1 11 6A7 7 0 0 1 6 16z" />
                            <path d="M6 16l3-4" />
                            
                            <path d="M14 5v5c0 1.5 1.5 2.5 3 2.5s3-1 3-2.5V5" />
                            <line x1="17" y1="5" x2="17" y2="19" />
                        </svg>
                        Diet
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Omnivore</div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Avg Size Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="1" y="8" width="22" height="8" rx="1"/><line x1="5" y1="8" x2="5" y2="12"/><line x1="9" y1="8" x2="9" y2="14"/><line x1="13" y1="8" x2="13" y2="12"/><line x1="17" y1="8" x2="17" y2="14"/></svg>
                        Avg Size
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Up to 4 feet 11</div>
                    <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px; display: inline-block;">Males ~70 kilograms, females ~50 kilograms</span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Behaviour & Zoo Location Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item" style="grid-column: span 2;">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
                        Behaviour & Zoo Location
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value" style="font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.3;">
                        Intelligent & sociable <br>
                        <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 8px; display: inline-block;">Located in The Chimpanzee House</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </section>

    </main>

    <!-- Khối tư liệu phim hợp tác bảo tồn rừng quốc gia Nigeria -->
    <section class="doc-band">
        <div class="dashed-border-top"></div>
        <div class="doc-container">
            <div class="doc-text">
                <h3>Guardian of the Canopy</h3>
                <p>We are partnering with the Nigerian National Parks Service to protect and conserve vital chimpanzee habitats from the threat of extinction.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/mQa4gAjjLPM?si=wTuamSB_9R1ypj8a" target="_blank" class="doc-btn">
                <span class="play-icon">▶</span> Watch Film
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="dashed-border-bottom"></div>
    </section>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            const slides = document.querySelectorAll('.carousel-slide');
            const totalSlides = slides.length;
            const indicator = document.getElementById('slideIndicator');
            let currentSlide = 0;

            function updateSlide(index) {
                slides.forEach(slide => slide.classList.remove('active'));
                slides[index].classList.add('active');
                indicator.textContent = `0${index + 1} / 0${totalSlides}`;
            }

            document.getElementById('nextBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
                currentSlide = (currentSlide + 1) % totalSlides;
                updateSlide(currentSlide);
            });

            document.getElementById('prevBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
                currentSlide = (currentSlide - 1 + totalSlides) % totalSlides;
                updateSlide(currentSlide);
            });

            updateSlide(currentSlide);
        });
    </script>


